From ee10a1fe6d70c8398606beecb920bba2b64b52af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 05:08:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] One UI style settings page and the camera options of One UI

The settings become a page like the One UI one: sections of rounded
groups, value rows whose options open in a dialog, switches; a row shows
only when the camera offers it. New options: QR codes in photo mode, a
histogram and the metering mode (matrix, centre-weighted, spot, set as
metering areas in Camera1 and Camera2) in PRO, a composition grid over the
picture, a vertical swipe to switch cameras, selfies saved as previewed
(mirrored EXIF orientation), the volume keys as the shutter (read from the
key device, the compositor keeps them from the window), vibration on the
shutter, reset of all settings, and the package version in About.

Signed-off-by: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
